# uv.lock stays local: on a Google cloudtop uv writes the corp package mirror's URL
# (airlock-proxy.uplink.goog) into every entry, and GitHub runners can't reach it.
# pyproject.toml pins the direct dependencies; CI resolves the rest from PyPI.
uv.lock

